72 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 58 0 R
/E (On behalf of the organizing committee, it is our great honor and pleasure to welcome you to Lanzhou for the 2026 International Conference on Smart Transportation and Future Mobility, which will take place from September 18 to 20, 2026. Hosted by Lanzhou Jiaotong University and co-organized by the CoreShare Academic Exchange Center, we are delighted to bring together the global community in this city where ancient heritage and modern innovation converge. We hope you will find both the academic program and the distinctive character of Lanzhou truly memorable.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
73 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 58 0 R
/E (We extend our sincere gratitude to our Conference Chairs, Professor Lei Nie and Professor Xichun Chen of Lanzhou Jiaotong University, whose vision and unwavering commitment have guided this event from conception to realization. Our appreciation also goes to every member of the organizing committee, whose dedicated efforts behind the scenes have made this gathering possible.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
74 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 58 0 R
/E (This conference brings together researchers, engineers, and practitioners from around the world, united by a shared commitment to addressing the critical challenges facing intelligent transportation and next-generation mobility. The remarkable quality and diversity of the submissions we received not only reflect the vitality of our discipline but also highlight the power of international collaboration in driving meaningful progress.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
